"BlooRabbit","id":56018661,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MDE4NjYx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56018661?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlooRabbit","html_url":"https://github.com/BlooRabbit","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlooRabbit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlooRabbit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlooRabbit/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlooRabbit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlooRabbit/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlooRabbit/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlooRabbit/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlooRabbit/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlooRabbit/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-09T12:56:35Z","updated_at":"2026-03-09T12:56:35Z","body":"The demo is currently donwloadable here: https://store.steampowered.com/app/4397270/Heidis_Legacy_Demo/","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4023565133/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4023731476","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117184#issuecomment-4023731476","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117184","id":4023731476,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7v1UUU","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-09T13:17:38Z","updated_at":"2026-03-09T13:17:38Z","body":"> ```\n> Canvas shader log\n> 370: instance_color.zw = unpackHalf2x16(uint(instance_color_custom_data.y));\n> 371: color *= instance_color;\n> 372: }\n> 373: if (bool(batch_flags & BATCH_FLAGS_INSTANCING_HAS_CUSTOM_DATA)) {\n> 374: instance_custom.xy = unpackHalf2x16(instance_color_custom_data.z);\n> 375: instance_custom.zw = unpackHalf2x16(instance_color_custom_data.w);\n> 376: }\n> \n> CanvasShaderGLES3: Vertex shader compilation failed:\n> ERROR: 0:347: No matching overloaded function found: unpackHalf2x16\n> ERROR: 0:347: Cannot convert from \"const float\" to \"vec2\"\n> ```\n\nThis code was added in #97151, CC @devloglogan @dsnopek @BastiaanOlij \n\nAccording to https://registry.khronos.org/OpenGL-Refpages/gl4/html/unpackHalf2x16.xhtml `unpackHalf2x16` is available in GLSL 4.20, and for Compatibility we use 3.30 on GL and 3.00 ES on GL ES:\n```\ndrivers/gles3/shader_gles3.cpp\n158:            builder.append(\"#version 330\\n\");\n161:            builder.append(\"#version 300 es\\n\");\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4023731476/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4023861352","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117184#issuecomment-4023861352","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117184","id":4023861352,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7v10Bo","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-09T13:38:32Z","updated_at":"2026-03-09T13:38:32Z","body":"> According to https://registry.khronos.org/OpenGL-Refpages/gl4/html/unpackHalf2x16.xhtml `unpackHalf2x16` is available in GLSL 4.20, and for Compatibility we use 3.30 on GL and 3.00 ES on GL ES:\n\nActually we define our own version of this function in `stdlib_inc.glsl`, gated with `USE_HALF2FLOAT`.\n\nSee #95797 for a previous issue about this, and #98327 for an attempted fix which had to be reverted.\n\nIt seems like at least on this ANGLE / GPU combo we do need `polyfill_half2float` config enabled.\nThere might also have been changed in recent ANGLE, we updated it for 4.6.\n\nCC @blueskythlikesclouds @clayjohn @bruvzg","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4023861352/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4023945059","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117184#issuecomment-4023945059","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117184","id":4023945059,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7v2Idj","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-09T13:51:38Z","updated_at":"2026-03-09T13:51:38Z","body":"ANGLE should always support it, it is GLES3.0 emulation, and these functions and part of GLES3.0 - https://registry.khronos.org/OpenGL-Refpages/es3.0/html/unpackHalf2x16.xhtml","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4023945059/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4023969671","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117184#issuecomment-4023969671","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117184","id":4023969671,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7v2OeH","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-09T13:55:28Z","updated_at":"2026-03-09T13:55:28Z","body":"> Reported by Sentry for users running Windows with the following GPUs:\n>\n> * AMD Radeon (TM) R5 M330\n> * AMD Radeon R9 200 Series\n\n@BlooRabbit Do the logs show you whether it's running ANGLE or native OpenGL? For ANGLE it looks like this in the line showing the renderer: \"OpenGL ES 3/ANGLE (Compatibility)\"","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4023969671/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4023978772","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117184#issuecomment-4023978772","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117184","id":4023978772,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7v2QsU","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-09T13:56:48Z","updated_at":"2026-03-09T13:56:48Z","body":"These GPUs should be in the list to force ANGLE.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4023978772/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4024145016","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117184#issuecomment-4024145016","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117184","id":4024145016,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7v25R4","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-09T14:22:00Z","updated_at":"2026-03-09T14:22:00Z","body":"> These GPUs should be in the list to force ANGLE.\n\nNote: it is enabled only if `rendering/gl_compatibility/fallback_to_angle` is true (default) and `rendering/gl_compatibility/force_angle_on_devices` was not modified, and it is not running under Wine.\n\nAnd it is not a custom build without ANGLE (check [Compiling with ANGLE support](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.html#compiling-with-angle-support)), if it's not compiled with ANGLE, it might attempt to load system `libGLESv2.dll` instead.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4024145016/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4024194423","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117184#issuecomment-4024194423","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117184","id":4024194423,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7v3FV3","user":{"login":"BlooRabbit","id":56018661,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MDE4NjYx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56018661?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlooRabbit","html_url":"https://github.com/BlooRabbit","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlooRabbit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlooRabbit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlooRabbit/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlooRabbit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlooRabbit/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlooRabbit/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlooRabbit/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlooRabbit/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlooRabbit/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-09T14:29:07Z","updated_at":"2026-03-09T14:29:07Z","body":"> [@BlooRabbit](https://github.com/BlooRabbit) Do the logs show you whether it's running ANGLE or native OpenGL? For ANGLE it looks like this in the line showing the renderer: \"OpenGL ES 3/ANGLE (Compatibility)\"\n\nI did not find the initial header log, unfortunately. With shader bugs Sentry sends so much data that it seems to flood the whole system.  The \"fallback to angle\" box was ticked. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4024194423/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4024317573","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117184#issuecomment-4024317573","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117184","id":4024317573,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7v3jaF","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-09T14:48:01Z","updated_at":"2026-03-09T14:48:13Z","body":"For the reference, https://store.steampowered.com/app/4397270/Heidis_Legacy_Demo/ is a custom build without builtin ANGLE:\n\n```\n> wine ./Edelweiss.exe --rendering-driver opengl3_angle\n\nGodot Engine v4.6.1.rc.custom_build - https://godotengine.org\n....\nERROR: Can't load EGL dynamic library.\n   at: EGLManager::initialize (drivers\\egl\\egl_manager.cpp:450)\nWARNING: Your video card drivers seem not to support GLES3 / ANGLE or ANGLE dynamic libraries (libEGL.dll and libGLESv2.dll) are missing, switching to native OpenGL.\n   at: DisplayServerWindows::DisplayServerWindows (platform\\windows\\display_server_windows.cpp:7438)\n```\n\nAnd I'm getting similar errors when running on M4 Pro mac with `--rendering-driver opengl3_angle` ( but not when running with native GL).\n\n```\nERROR: SceneShaderGLES3: Fragment shader compilation failed:\nERROR: 0:1519: Invalid call of undeclared identifier 'packHalf2x16'\nERROR: 0:1520: Invalid call of undeclared identifier 'packHalf2x16'\nERROR: 0:1875: Use of undeclared identifier 'fog_rg'\nERROR: 0:1876: Use of undeclared identifier 'fog_ba'\n```\n\nSo it is likely an issue with how `polyfill_half2float` is set when fallback to/from ANGLE fails.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4024317573/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]